Portions of three stage prompts are derived from superpowers skills:

  pipeline/stages/implementing.md  "## Test-driven development"
      from skills/test-driven-development/SKILL.md
  pipeline/stages/planning.md      "## Writing the plan"
      from skills/writing-plans/SKILL.md
  pipeline/stages/triage.md        "## Finding the real failure"
      from skills/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md

They were `skills:` frontmatter entries -- invoked at runtime from an installed
plugin -- until 2026-08-22, when they were inlined to drop the dependency. The
text is trimmed and adapted: language-specific examples, pointers to files not
present here, and passages addressed to an interactive human partner were
removed, since a pipeline stage runs unattended.

